+### Contact Us Security Verification (Cloudflare Turnstile)
+
+When the inquiry page loads and security verification takes place, the following information may be transmitted over the network to and processed by Cloudflare.
+
+| Item | Details |
+| --- | --- |
+| Recipient | Cloudflare, Inc. (privacy contact: dpo@cloudflare.com) |
+| Items transferred | IP address, browser User-Agent, TLS fingerprint, sitekey and associated origin |
+| Countries of transfer | The United States and Europe |
+| Time and method | Over the network when the inquiry page is loaded and security verification is performed |
+| Purpose | Detection and blocking of automated malicious requests and security verification of the inquiry form |
+| Retention period | Until the purpose of processing is achieved. Deleted or returned at the Company's choice when the agreement ends or the purpose is achieved |
+
+Turnstile does not access, store, or transmit form entries or other page inputs. Cloudflare acts as a processor providing website security services on behalf of the Company. For processing to improve Turnstile's bot detection capabilities, Cloudflare acts as a controller processing the information for its own purposes, and Cloudflare's privacy policy applies.
+
+The detailed list of countries and the deletion and return procedure follow [Cloudflare's standard DPA](https://www.cloudflare.com/cloudflare-customer-dpa/), and the details of the signals processed follow the [Cloudflare Turnstile Privacy Addendum](https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/).
+
+Requests to refuse the transfer may be made to [legal@querypie.com](mailto:legal@querypie.com). If you refuse the security verification performed through Turnstile, submission of the inquiry form will be restricted.
+
+The Company uses cloud services after carefully reviewing the information protection and personal information protection compliance status of the cloud service provider, and the cloud service provider does not have access to the customer personal information stored by the Company. However, information processed by Cloudflare for Contact Us security verification is subject to the "Contact Us Security Verification (Cloudflare Turnstile)" section of this Article.
